---
description: Sobral Psico shell — keep product content out until it is requested
globs:
  - frontend/**/*
  - backend/**/*
  - .github/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

This repo is the empty shell for an anonymous employee welfare questionnaire under Brazil's updated NR-1 (psychosocial risks). Do not import content, branding, or data from other projects.

Frontend calls the API only through `ApiService` and `environment.apiUrl`. Production uses the Netlify `/api/v1` proxy. `/studio` stays off the public nav. Studio issues must not receive the `solve` label automatically.
